# The blintz fold written in ORIPA's numeric .cp format, which ORI also reads:
#   type x1 y1 x2 y2    1 = paper edge, 2 = mountain, 3 = valley
1 -200 -200 200 -200
1 200 -200 200 200
1 200 200 -200 200
1 -200 200 -200 -200
3 0 -200 -200 0
3 -200 0 0 200
3 0 200 200 0
3 200 0 0 -200
2 -200 0 200 0
2 0 -200 0 200
